This directory contains business information:

   ORDER - order form which you can print on your printer, and mail/fax to us
   PRICES - price list
   CONTACTS - how to reach Code Farms
   LICENSE - full text of the license which applies to single users or
             small site licenses (up to 30 programmers);
             as you will see there are practically no legal restrictions
             in using the library
   SITE - sample of a typical legal agreement for company-wide licenses.
